	•	What is the annual path?
	•	Which security limitations should be understood?
Its primary CTA should be:
Build Your Pilot Plan
This scrolls to or opens the form on the same page.
After form submission
The buyer enters the approval process through email:
Review Your Proposed Pilot
This progression is semantically clean:

Scope
→ Build
→ Review
→ Confirm
→ Sign

Your landing page and form play different roles
Paid pilot landing page
Persuades and clarifies.
It explains the standardized commercial offer and proactively addresses objections.
Pilot form
Qualifies and configures.
It collects the variables required to produce the proposal.
Email approval flow
Resolves and closes.
It lets the prospect confirm assumptions, request bounded changes, sign, pay, and schedule kickoff.
Do not combine all three functions into one massive interface.
